<title>USA: Noble Drilling added to S&amp;P MidCap 400.</title>
<headline>Noble Drilling added to S&amp;P MidCap 400.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Wednesday that it will replace PHH Corp in the S&amp;P MidCap 400 Index with Noble Drilling Corp after the close of trading April 30, 1997.</p>
<p>PHH Corp is being acquired by HFS Inc, a component of the S&amp;P 500 Index, in a friendly stock merger.</p>
<p>Noble Drilling will be replaced in the S&amp;P SmallCap 600 Index by Checkpoint Systems Inc, Standard &amp; Poor's said.</p>
<p>Checkpoint Systems designs and manufactures integrated electronic security systems used by retailers to deter theft of merchandise, Standard &amp; Poor's said.</p>
</text>
